---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<p>
  This Privacy Policy explains how {site.legalName} ("cverse", "we", "us") handles personal data when you
  visit <a href={site.url}>{site.url.replace('https://', '')}</a> (the "Site") or contact us. We are a company
  registered in the United Arab Emirates and process personal data in accordance with UAE Federal Decree-Law
  No. 45 of 2021 on the Protection of Personal Data and other applicable laws.
</p>

<h2>Who we are</h2>
<p>
  {site.legalName}<br />
  {site.address.lines[0]}, {site.address.lines[1]}<br />
  Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
</p>

<h2>What data we collect</h2>
<p>The Site is an informational website. It has no user accounts, forms or comment features.</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Technical data.</strong> When you visit the Site, our hosting provider automatically records
    standard server log data such as your IP address, browser type, device type, referring page, pages
    viewed and timestamps. This is used to deliver the Site, keep it secure and understand aggregate usage.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Correspondence.</strong> If you email us, we receive your email address, name and whatever
    you choose to include in your message. We use it to reply to you and, where relevant, to prepare a
    proposal or enter into a business relationship.
  </li>
</ul>
<p>We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 18.</p>

<h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
<p>
  The Site does not set advertising or tracking cookies and does not use third-party analytics scripts.
  Fonts and other assets are served from our own domain. If we introduce analytics in the future we will
  update this policy and, where required, ask for your consent first.
</p>

<h2>Why we process your data</h2>
<ul>
  <li>To operate, secure and improve the Site (our legitimate interest).</li>
  <li>To respond to enquiries and manage prospective and existing client relationships (performance of a contract or steps prior to a contract).</li>
  <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Sharing</h2>
<p>
  We share personal data only with service providers who help us run the Site and our business (for example
  web hosting and email providers), and only to the extent needed for them to provide their services. We may
  also disclose data where required by law or to protect our rights. We do not sell personal data.
</p>

<h2>International transfers</h2>
<p>
  Our service providers may store data outside the UAE. Where that happens we take steps to ensure the data
  receives an adequate level of protection, such as contractual safeguards.
</p>

<h2>Retention</h2>
<p>
  Server logs are kept for a limited period for security purposes and then deleted or anonymized. Business
  correspondence is kept for as long as needed to manage the relationship and to meet legal, accounting and
  record-keeping requirements.
</p>

<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>
  Subject to applicable law, you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data,
  object to or restrict certain processing, and withdraw consent where processing is based on consent. To
  exercise these rights, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You may also have the right
  to lodge a complaint with the UAE Data Office.
</p>

<h2>Security</h2>
<p>
  We use appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect personal data, including encrypted
  connections (HTTPS) and access controls. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure.
</p>

<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>
  We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top shows when it last
  changed. Material changes will be highlighted on this page.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about this policy or our data practices: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
